<Base title="Our Team | ITKeepers"><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Our team</p><h1>Outsourced IT.<br>Without feeling outsourced.</h1><p class="lead">ITKeepers works as a coordinated engineering team: familiar people supported by colleagues with deeper expertise when the work calls for it.</p></section><section class="section light"><div class="split"><h2>Small enough for context.<br>Built for collaboration.</h2><div><p>Clients should not have to explain their environment from scratch every time they need help. Familiarity matters, and so does shared documentation.</p><p>Approved names, roles and real team photography will be added here rather than using stock employees or invented titles.</p></div></div></section></Base>